ge Quality:**\n- **Clarity:** Crystal clear image, Ultra sharp, Pristine clarity, High definition, Transparent image\n- **Color & Tone:** Vibrant colors, Rich tones, Deep blacks, Brilliant whites, Color grading\n- **Photographic Style:** Photorealistic, Studio photography, Commercial photography, High fashion photography, Fine art photography, Cinematic still\n\n**Technical Parameters (Auxiliary, not core):**\n- (Optional, add sparingly): 8K, Ultra detailed, Masterpiece, Best quality, Highly detailed, Volumetric light, Physically based rendering (PBR), Ray tracing"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 162, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Prompt Template(English)", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.20.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [381.8741455078125, 110.5600357055664], "pos": [-283.05419921875, 3359.660400390625], "widgets_values": ["A female elf in a forest wearing an archer uniform. Western aesthetics. full body shot"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 166, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Prompt 提示词", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.20.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Additional light source options: Copy the desired options into the template above.\n\nrainbow lighting, dawn/twilight, aurora, starlight/moonlight, midday sunlight, evening sunlight, morning sunlight, cloudy lighting, fog lighting, oblique highlights from outside the window, backlighting, 